Right on schedule, the remaining manticore folds its wings in a steep dive for Leila. She holds still until the shadow sweeps over her, then pivots and delivers a clean upward slash through its chest. The beast crashes hard, and she finishes it with a swift strike to the neck. We back away from the cobras while their glands regenerate.

Only the cobras and tramplers remain. The snakes are coiling for another volley, while the tramplers line up their charge across open sand.

}
choice("Continue", B2-Ch04b-Strength-check, v_current_scene = B2-Ch04b-Strength-check)


ID: B2-Ch04b-Barry-tramplers
TEXT:

set(v_ac_b2_ch4_trampler,1)
achievement("Trampler slayer",v_ac_b2_ch4_trampler)
#if(v_b2_ch2_fist != 1 && v_b2_ch2_fist != 2) {
 The tramplers lower their horns and charge. I sprint straight toward them across the sand.

Creature lore: tramplers are territorial bullies unaccustomed to head-on challenges. Run straight at a charging trampler without flinching, and its predatory instincts short-circuit into hesitation.

If my notebook is wrong, I am about to become paste on the arena wall.

We close the distance at full speed. Twelve feet out, the tramplers skid to a halt, stomping the dirt and swinging their heavy, spiked mace tails in a defensive threat display.

Exactly what I wanted. A trampler's lethal power comes from momentum. Static tail swipes won't stop me.

}
#if(v_b2_ch2_fist == 1 || v_b2_ch2_fist == 2) {
 The tramplers lower their horns and charge. I sprint straight toward them across the sand.

Creature lore: tramplers are territorial bullies unaccustomed to head-on challenges. Run straight at a charging trampler without flinching, and its predatory instincts short-circuit into hesitation.

