Not bad.

I turn to check Leila and Bruce. Both cobras are dead, and they are jogging toward me.

What about the marauders?

}
#if(v_b2_ch4_tactic == 1 && v_b2_ch2_fist != 1 && v_b2_ch2_fist != 2) {
